 "text": "Hey, how are you holding up? You want move away from bright orange and towards natural. A light base helps hide reds and oranges without making you glow. Yes, and a light shade too. Use a reflector if you only have one light. Use a shadow card to see how your skin looks in different light. It' a small card with a shadow that opens up a real light. Start with mid tone for your skin, then add a bit more if it looks flat. A bit of gold can make fair skin glow, so only use it if you have strong lights and a warm background. Try mid tone for skin, and only a little bit of gold if your light source is strong.",
